// The picture behind Eren's narration (CG-mode text), original art: the
// Colossal Titan looking over Wall Maria. FE8U always draws gCGDataTable[0]
// here (GetCG ignores its index), so this replaces CG 0.
// Converted from Backgrounds/NarrationCG.png by tools/cgconv.py.

